{"4474360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Illusionary Manor", "steam_appid": 4474360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusionary Manor</strong> is a 3D first-person adventure puzzle game where the player will explore a magical mansion filled with paintings from all corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Michele, a young artist kidnapped from his own wedding and brought to a mysterious manor filled with paintings — a place where art is alive. To escape, you must step inside the broken paintings, interact with their worlds, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets that were never meant to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5ad58a35b0cfb488391333d033027f52.avif?t=1785937525\" width=780 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter legendary works of art — each painting is a living, breathing world with its own rules, atmosphere, and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/645dcc05c51237471c5dfd60c8d6c3b5.avif?t=1785937525\" width=791 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Original characters with unique personalities and side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Handcrafted puzzles inspired by classical artworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A magical world where art comes alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/43e9f47e05eda43cbdfdde964db1f666.webp?t=1785937525\" width=780 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with surreal environments, uncover hidden mechanics, and use logic and observation to restore balance within each painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/d0940e3cba1c5f02df48055fc952bf14.avif?t=1785937525\" width=780 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every restored painting unlocks new parts of the Illusionary Manor and gives you new ways to interact with the mansion around you. Explore a nonlinear mansion, revisit familiar rooms from a new perspective, uncover the hidden story of this place, and face the personal struggles buried beneath the search for escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/3e138bf224a5a35ff2a8cba1cc037f33.avif?t=1785937525\" width=780 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and assist the living spirits of the manor — each with their own secrets, manners, and reasons to stay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boozy</strong>, a refined owl with a sharp tongue, is always nearby in a noble posture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jestario</strong>, a graceful painted shadow and the manor’s guardian, smiles politely while hiding far more than he says.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other strange inhabitants</strong>, each with their own troubles to solve, stories to share, and reasons to follow you deeper into the manor. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn their stories, earn their trust, and discover what truly keeps the Illusionary Manor alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusionary Manor</strong> is a 3D first-person adventure puzzle game where the player will explore a magical mansion filled with paintings from all corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Michele, a young artist kidnapped from his own wedding and brought to a mysterious manor filled with paintings — a place where art is alive. To escape, you must step inside the broken paintings, interact with their worlds, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets that were never meant to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5ad58a35b0cfb488391333d033027f52.avif?t=1785937525\" width=780 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.poster.avif?t=1785937525\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.webm?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.mp4?t=1785937525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter legendary works of art — each painting is a living, breathing world with its own rules, atmosphere, and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/645dcc05c51237471c5dfd60c8d6c3b5.avif?t=1785937525\" width=791 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\